[00:23.90]1. We live in a world that is wayward and lost;
[00:25.90]The way of our God is not known.
[00:29.90]We need sure direction to safeguard our steps;
[00:34.90]We cannot succeed on our own.
[00:38.90]Our meetings refresh us and brighten our hope;
[00:44.35]They help us build faith in our God.
[00:47.79]They move us with words that incite to fine deeds,
[00:52.19]They give us the strength to go on.
[00:56.55]We’ll never forsake what Jehovah commands;
[01:00.91]His will is what we want to do.
[01:05.37]Our meetings instruct us in ways that are right;
[01:09.57]Our love for the truth they renew.
[01:24.48]2. Jehovah is keenly aware of our needs;
[01:27.98]His counsel by us should be heard.
[01:31.48]To buy out the time for occasions to meet
[01:35.76]Shows wisdom and trust in his Word.
[01:40.82]By wholesome instruction from God-fearing men,
[01:45.88]We learn how our faith can be shown.
[01:47.88]With loving support from our fam’ly of faith,
[01:52.88]We know that we’re never alone.
[01:56.88]So as we look forward to much better times,
[02:01.88]We’ll meet with the ones whom we love.
[02:07.29]And here at these meetings we’ll learn how to live
[02:18.29]With wisdom that comes from above.